[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0010","text":"——喂，透"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0020","text":"外套，我给你拿来了\n上台之前还是穿着比较好吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0030","text":"……嗯，啊\n嗯？我不冷啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0040","text":"话是这么说，\n但肚子着凉了可不好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0050","text":"……不是说了吗\n你家人很担心你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0060","text":"嗯？\n……啊——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0070","text":"呵呵\n嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0080","text":"谢谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0090","text":"我会告诉妈妈的\n侧台那边倒还好——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0100","text":"一上台，\n就很热的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
